            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanuka ŋun ebuni aisumunet kotoma aiyuun, tetere egoŋakina aisumunet asianut, kitogogoŋoi da mama ejai aur kere, mere mama ejaas ŋul luka ikisila bon, dimarai mama ejaas ŋul luka aiyuun naka Aburaam, (loerai papaawok kere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
